# City goals on the Hill Bomb (kinds speed and bomb): the race line of sf-bomb-race passes 55 km/h
# on Dolores (speed in a box) and finishes in 10.49 s (Hill Bomb Under 11); its two powerslides
# are brakes, so No Brakes on Dolores stays open.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run bomb
hold up 20..200
hold ollie 200..2400
hold slide 1220..1290
hold slide 1560..1630
run 1760
expect event goalComplete{id=dolores55,area=Dolores} within 1160..1175
expect event bombFinish{braked=true} within 1690..1705
expect event goalComplete{id=bomb11} within 1690..1705
expect no event goalComplete{id=nobrakes}
